          "type": "Double&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "A check is done to verify that:\n- the curve is degenerated in the parametric space of the carrier surface i.e. the 2D length of the curve is not nearly equal to zero\n- the curve is degenerated in 3D i.e. the 3D length of the curve is not nearly equal to zero\nA curve can be degenerated in 3D and not in 2D in the case of locally degenerated carrier surface."
